# Route: guide 35 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Human (1452
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.9 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 52 to 53, 25
# quests, 1.1 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Darnassus, Teldrassil): near Craftsmen's Terrace -> Craftsmen's
# Terrace -> near Craftsmen's Terrace -> Rut'theran Village -> Wellspring Lake
